{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KILL THEM ALL AND NEVER STOP!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Blimblau: Kill Them All!</i> is a <strong>retro-style Boomer Shooter FPS</strong> inspired by the classics of the \u201890s. Developed by a single indie dev, it delivers pure fast-paced action, violent combat, and gritty pixelated 2.5D/3D graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll face endless waves of <strong>modified humans</strong>, their origin unknown, coming at you without rest. Blast your way through, tear them apart, and survive the bloodbath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode</strong>: uncover, step by step, the mystery behind the modified humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade Mode</strong>: pure mayhem with nonstop enemies and bullets flying everywhere.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready: <strong>there\u2019s only one rule \u2014 kill them all.</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Level 01","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4003520/b3f6acce5eef3cead06041e5a4971289ae197dde.jpg"},{"name":"Level 02","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4003520/63790852ee1500d89d1996ba242f7cd9aecaee12.jpg"},{"name":"Level 03","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4003520/c212cb4fc28dead3608a4763e107d9b82b2ade35.jpg"},{"name":"Level 04","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4003520/1fbd6ecf459aa1eab44122f4d76ea266a289ac47.jpg"},{"name":"Level 05","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4003520/2fe23669015bae04b44307b3